# Where the deployed pieces of this project actually live.
#
# Committed on purpose. These are published addresses — anyone who opens the
# site can read them out of the page source — so they are configuration, not
# credentials. Nothing secret belongs in this file; the database URL and the
# deploy hooks live in Actions secrets and in Render's own environment.
#
# This exists so there is one place to change when something moves. The Pages
# workflow reads the value from here rather than carrying a literal URL, and a
# repository variable of the same name overrides it without a commit — useful
# for pointing a branch at a staging API.
#
# Naming follows `env/.env.shared`: `*_PUBLIC_URL` is an address reachable from
# a browser, as opposed to `*_INTERNAL_URL` on a compose network.

# The healthcare demo's API, deployed from apps/healthcare-demo/render.yaml.
# The published frontend calls this instead of replaying its capture. Override:
# the `HEALTHCARE_API_BASE` repository variable.
HEALTHCARE_DEMO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://dagents-healthcare-api.onrender.com
